{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>EarPal Translator 是一款在裝置內完成即時語音與鏡頭文字翻譯的工具，適合外遊人士、語言學習者、多語家庭，以及需要即時字幕的聽障或聽力較弱用戶。目前該 App 終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>兌換中，原價為 US $39.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-170.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>多語對話即時分色翻譯</h2>\n<p>EarPal Translator 以裝置內人工智能模型處理語音、影像與翻譯，錄音、相片與辨識文字不會離開 iPhone，沒有廣告與追蹤。它可同時辨識多位說話者，文字模式以顏色區分，配合 AirPods 收聽時以不同合成聲音分辨。相機對準菜單、路牌或截圖即時疊上譯文，並提供準確與即時字幕兩種模式，涵蓋 30 多種語言。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-68-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-69-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-70-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-71-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-72-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-73-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<h2>限時免費兌換終生版</h2>\n<p>EarPal Translator 終生版限時免費中，用戶透過兌換連結領取，注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。兌換連結數目有限，額滿即止。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：EarPal Translator</li>\n<li>應用類別：Travel</li>\n<li>兌換位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/redeem?ctx=offercodes&amp;id=6761786603&amp;code=EARPALWINTER\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a> （額滿即止）</li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:04:23.241600+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":438,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T23:41:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:33.316967+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:57:51.364889+00:00","content_hash":"bc89f111b2eca75306e18662c97a7bf10121d645c89a5ddfad8becadd24d881e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}